msgstr "Pick up sap drops on the way: they make you grow a little."

msgid "STAGECARD_EGG_TIP3"
msgstr "Jump on an ant and you knock it out!"

msgid "STAGECARD_EGG_KEYS"
msgstr "Arrows or A/D: run · Space: jump (hold it to jump higher)"

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_EARLY_KIND"
msgstr "Turn-based battle"

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_EARLY_GOAL"
msgstr "Every level has its own challenge: drive off ants, reach a branch, rescue a sister..."

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_EARLY_TIP1"
msgstr "On your turn, move (Jump or Backflip to cross obstacles), then tap Aim."

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_EARLY_TIP2"
msgstr "Pick a weapon, drag to aim and hold FIRE to charge the power. Let go to shoot!"

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_EARLY_TIP3"
msgstr "The wind bends your shots. Pass ends your turn, and Caterpillar ⇄ switches caterpillar."

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_EARLY_KEYS"
msgstr "Arrows: walk and aim · Enter: jump · Backspace: backflip · Space (hold): fire · Tab: next caterpillar · N: pass"

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_KIND"
msgstr "Turn-based battle, tougher"

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_GOAL"
msgstr "Drive off the enemies, gather pine nuts, land one good shot or blow up barrels... The Great Tit waits at the end."

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_TIP1"
msgstr "The same controls as before, but with stingier hairs and new weapons."

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_TIP2"
msgstr "Birds attack from the sky: they hover for a moment before swooping. Use it!"

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_TIP3"
msgstr "You are a gang: switch caterpillar and pick the one with the best shot."

msgid "STAGECARD_LARVA_KEYS"
msgstr "Arrows: walk and aim · Enter: jump · Backspace: backflip · Space (hold): fire · Tab: next caterpillar · N: pass"

msgid "STAGECARD_NEST_KIND"
msgstr "Turn-based nest defence"

msgid "STAGECARD_NEST_GOAL"
msgstr "Keep the silk nest standing: if its HP runs out, you lose. At the end, send the Foreman away."

msgid "STAGECARD_NEST_TIP1"
msgstr "Stand next to the nest and tap Repair: it uses your action and gives it HP. Inside, blows hurt half as much."

msgid "STAGECARD_NEST_TIP2"
msgstr "It is cold! Outside the nest you lose HP, unless you own the Warm silk upgrade."

msgid "STAGECARD_NEST_TIP3"
msgstr "The foresters' pole hits a band: an orange stripe shows where it will land, one turn ahead."

msgid "STAGECARD_NEST_KEYS"
msgstr "Arrows: walk and aim · Enter: jump · Space (hold): fire · T: repair · Tab: next caterpillar · N: pass"

msgid "STAGECARD_PROCESSION_KIND"
msgstr "Turn-based march in a line"

msgid "STAGECARD_PROCESSION_GOAL"
msgstr "Lead the front caterpillar to the soft soil to bury yourselves: you win there."

msgid "STAGECARD_PROCESSION_TIP1"
msgstr "You only control the leader: the others follow her silk thread."

msgid "STAGECARD_PROCESSION_TIP2"
msgstr "Each turn you can walk as far as the bar on top shows. A follower left too far behind gets lost: walk back near her!"

msgid "STAGECARD_PROCESSION_TIP3"
msgstr "Watch out for the boar, the fungus clouds and the calosoma."

msgid "STAGECARD_PROCESSION_KEYS"
msgstr "Arrows: walk · Enter: jump · Space (hold): fire · C: silk thread · N: pass"

msgid "STAGECARD_PUPA_KIND"
msgstr "Underground platformer: digging"

msgid "STAGECARD_PUPA_GOAL"
msgstr "Dig your way to the safe chamber."

msgid "STAGECARD_PUPA_TIP1"
msgstr "Hold an arrow against the soil: the tunnels you dig are your path."

msgid "STAGECARD_PUPA_TIP2"
msgstr "Stones fall when you dig the soil under them: do not walk under them!"

msgid "STAGECARD_PUPA_TIP3"
msgstr "Digging is noisy and the hoopoe listens: stay still and it will not hear you. If water rises, keep moving!"

msgid "STAGECARD_PUPA_KEYS"
msgstr "Arrows or WASD: dig · Space: a little hop"

msgid "STAGECARD_MOTH_KIND"
msgstr "Night-flight platformer"

msgid "STAGECARD_MOTH_GOAL"
msgstr "Fly to the end of the way, dodging lamps, traps and nightjars."

msgid "STAGECARD_MOTH_TIP1"
msgstr "Each tap of FLAP is a wing beat. Hold it down to glide and fall more slowly."

msgid "STAGECARD_MOTH_TIP2"
msgstr "Lamps pull you in: flap the other way. A trap sends you back to the last flag."

msgid "STAGECARD_MOTH_TIP3"
msgstr "Hide in the shadows: nobody can see you inside."

msgid "STAGECARD_MOTH_KEYS"
msgstr "Arrows: steer · Space: flap (hold it to glide)"

msgid "STORY_RESULT_SILK_GAIN"
msgstr "+%d silk"

msgid "STORY_RESULT_SILK_TOTAL"
msgstr "You now have %d to spend in El Bolsó"

msgid "STORY_RESULT_SILK_NONE"
msgstr "You already have this level's stars: no new silk."

msgid "STORY_RESULT_SILK_BEST"
msgstr "Best: %d ★. Beat it to earn more silk."

msgid "SILK_PART_WIN"
msgstr "Victory +%d"

msgid "SILK_PART_STARS"
msgstr "New stars ×%d: +%d"

msgid "SILK_PART_BOSS"
msgstr "Stage boss +%d"

